  "gate": [
   "The Wardgate of Corvanthe",
   "Barred from the outside under a city watch seal gone green with age, but somebody has cut a man-sized door through the bar. Bruise-coloured light flickers along the top of the wall, and the air tastes of copper."
  ],
  "camp": [
   "Gleaner Camp",
   "Bedrolls, a cold firepit, crates stencilled with a crowned skull. Whoever camped here went over the wall and left their supper on the coals."
  ],
